 style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reconciled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"receipts_archived\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"degradations\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0031</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"stages\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"window_state\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"watchlist\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"sync_lag_p99_minutes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"pending_reviews\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">61</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"suppressions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"active_rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">34</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max_share_single_rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"cdd\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reviews_due\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2140</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"completed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2088</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"overdue\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">52</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"generated_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-01T02:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"immutable_hash\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sha256:...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这份证据包的设计体现了一个重要原则：<strong>把检查可能问的每个问题都预先变成一个数字</strong>。检查员问&quot;你们有没有超期&quot;，答案是 3；问&quot;降级多不多&quot;，答案是 0.31%，并附上分阶段归因；问&quot;白名单有没有被滥用&quot;，答案是单条规则最高占比 18%。预先量化让对话从&quot;你们做得怎么样&quot;转变为&quot;这个数字为什么是这样&quot;，后者是可控的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"现场响应的分工\">现场响应的分工</h3><p>检查现场需要三类角色的配合：<strong>合规对口人</strong>负责与检查员沟通口径、<strong>系统负责人</strong>负责供应技术证据、<strong>业务负责人</strong>负责解释具体案件。常见的失败是让技术人员直接回答合规问题（会用技术语言描述，容易被理解为规避），或让合规人员解释技术细节（会给出不准确的描述）。提前确定分工并在演练中验证，是低成本高回报的准备。</p>\n<h3 id=\"发现问题的正确处置\">发现问题的正确处置</h3><p>检查中发现问题是常态。正确的处置是：确认事实、评估影响范围（同类问题还有多少处）、制定修复计划并明确期限、以及记录整个处置过程。试图模糊或最小化问题，一旦被检查员发现，其后果远大于问题本身。第 4.2 篇的调优记录与本文的留档机制，共同构成了&quot;发现问题—修复—留痕&quot;的闭环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>监管检查的实质是验证过去一段时间内系统是否持续按声称的方式运行，考的是证据连续性与自洽性，而非当下指标。</li>\n<li>留档必须是运行副产品：不可变（追加写 + 权限限制）且可追溯（时间、主体、依据、前后状态差异）。</li>\n<li>四类证据（设计/运行/报送/治理）获取难度递增，运行证据最易出问题，静默降级与白名单滥用是典型信号。</li>\n<li>系统应主动记录并呈现降级统计，可疑的零比诚实的小数字更危险。</li>\n<li>用周期性自动生成的合规证据包替代临时冲刺式准备，把检查可能问的每个问题预先变成数字。</li>\n<li>发现问题的正确处置是确认、评估影响范围、制定修复计划并留痕，而非模糊化。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关：规则变更的审批依据见 <a href=\"../customer-risk-tuning/alert-tuning-false-positive\">规则调优与误报治理</a>；案件与报送记录的来源见 <a href=\"../alert-investigation-report/suspicious-ctr-str-report\">大额/可疑交易报告（CTR/STR）</a>；风险分级的时点快照要求见 <a href=\"../customer-risk-tuning/customer-risk-rating-cdd-edd\">客户风险分级与 CDD/EDD</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"监管检查与留档","id":"监管检查与留档"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"留档的基本要求","id":"留档的基本要求"},{"level":3,"text":"不可变性与可追溯性","id":"不可变性与可追溯性"},{"level":3,"text":"留存年限与归档","id":"留存年限与归档"},{"level":2,"text":"检查中的高频发现","id":"检查中的高频发现"},{"level":3,"text":"设计层面的发现","id":"设计层面的发现"},{"level":3,"text":"运行层面的发现","id":"运行层面的发现"},{"level":3,"text":"报送层面的发现","id":"报送层面的发现"},{"level":2,"text":"应对检查的准备","id":"应对检查的准备"},{"level":3,"text":"常态化而非临时化","id":"常态化而非临时化"},{"level":3,"text":"现场响应的分工","id":"现场响应的分工"},{"level":3,"text":"发现问题的正确处置","id":"发现问题的正确处置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"规则调优与误报治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/aml-transaction-monitoring/customer-risk-tuning/alert-tuning-false-positive"},"next":null}